    "Name": "Hammerhands HMH-3D",
    "Details": "An early FedSuns BattleMech, the 75 ton Hammerhands debuted in 2475 and served as one of the progenitor designs that would influence the iconic Warhammer. Powered by a 225-rated Fusion Core, the customised Hammerhands HMH-3D used by Lorn Kessem is armed with a pair of LB-10X’s, with a pair of Medium Lasers and an SRM-6 for close range combat.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Barrel Fist</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.13</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Lower, Right Lower</color>",
